# Arvin — Cursor Governance Adapter

This is a thin adapter. Do not duplicate the policy.

- Before acting, read root `AGENTS.md`, `AI_CONTINUITY_PROTOCOL.md`, `PROJECT_STATE.md`, then `docs/project-continuity/AI_GOVERNANCE_POLICY.md` and its mandatory reading sequence.
- Verify live GitHub Main, branch, PR, exact HEAD and checks before claims or writes.
- Latest explicit Mobin authorization controls scope. Documentation-only is not code permission.
- Preserve historical decisions; unresolved conflicts remain NEEDS OWNER DECISION.
- SQL is the only durable product source of truth; no parallel durable JSON storage.
- No direct Main writes, force push, merge, release, test weakening or destructive migration without separate explicit authorization.

Canonical policy: `docs/project-continuity/AI_GOVERNANCE_POLICY.md`.
